# Stop → tar these paths → start. The server saves the galaxy on SIGTERM, so a stopped server
# leaves a consistent folder; a copy taken while it runs can catch a half-written save.
#
# The galaxy folder holds everything that belongs to this server: the save (sectors, players),
# server.ini (including rconPassword), modconfig.lua, the access lists and the server logs.
data/galaxy
#
# Not listed: data/backups — the game's own hourly backups of the same galaxy. Add it if you want
# those inside the archive too; it only makes the archive larger.
